  "title": "Enable or disable a stream's destination"
 },
 "description": "Stop or resume sending to one of a stream's destinations without removing it. Disabling works while the stream is live \u2014 that output goes off the air at once \u2014 except for its last enabled destination (LAST_DESTINATION: stop_stream instead). Enabling is refused while live (STREAM_LIVE). Returns the stream's whole destination list after the change, as list_stream_destinations does.",
